      "comment": "Like the return of CAVENDISH (1) who was runner-up fresh in higher grade. Former Snowden galloper who was in great form for the new yard in Alice Springs before a break. Strong second fresh and will take catching again fitter for it. GALAXY GENERAL (5) gave a sight off a wide draw last time. Was an easy course and distance winner the start prior and should be in the finish. ROMANTIC LOVE (6) pushed forward from a wide draw last time and covered ground before boxing on well for fourth. Will give a sight again. IF I WAS YOU (7) ran very well first try in this area when placed over 1100m and can only be better for it. LIMITED RISK (2) gave a sight at odds last time and can do the same.",
